{
  "id": "grammar-9",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 9,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "關係代名詞：who、which、that",
  "titleEn": "Relative Pronouns",
  "summary": "用一個字把兩句話接起來，說明「是哪一個人或東西」。",
  "minutes": 15,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「穿紅衣服的那個人」，修飾的話放在前面。英文會把說明放在後面：the man who is wearing red。",
        "說明「人」用 who，說明「東西」用 which，that 人和東西都可以用。",
        "whose 表示「…的」，例如 the woman whose car is red（車子是紅色的那位女士）。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "看前面的名詞是人還是東西："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "前面的名詞",
          "用",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "人",
            "who／that",
            "the man who called you"
          ],
          [
            "東西、動物",
            "which／that",
            "the email which I sent"
          ],
          [
            "…的（所有）",
            "whose",
            "the client whose order was late"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "多益看到空格前面是人（employee、customer），先想 who；是東西（report、product），先想 which。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "The woman who called you is my boss.",
          "zh": "打電話給你的那位女士是我的主管。",
          "highlight": "who",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-9/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "This is the report which I wrote.",
          "zh": "這是我寫的報告。",
          "highlight": "which",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-9/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "I have a friend who lives in Paris.",
          "zh": "我有一個住在巴黎的朋友。",
          "highlight": "who",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-9/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "He is the client whose order was late.",
          "zh": "他就是訂單延遲的那位客戶。",
          "highlight": "whose",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-9/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The man",
              "label": "人"
            },
            {
              "text": "who",
              "label": "說明這個人"
            },
            {
              "text": "is talking",
              "label": "他在做什麼"
            },
            {
              "text": "is our CEO.",
              "label": "主要的句子"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "who 帶出的話，說明是哪一個人"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "The laptop",
              "label": "東西"
            },
            {
              "text": "which",
              "label": "說明這個東西"
            },
            {
              "text": "I bought",
              "label": "補充說明"
            },
            {
              "text": "is very fast.",
              "label": "主要的句子"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "which 說明是哪一台筆電"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "The man which called you is here.",
          "right": "The man who called you is here.",
          "why": "man 是人，用 who。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "This is the book who I like.",
          "right": "This is the book which I like.",
          "why": "book 是東西，用 which（或 that）。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "She is the girl who her bag is red.",
          "right": "She is the girl whose bag is red.",
          "why": "「她的包包」要用 whose。"
        }
      ]
    },
